+### E-35 Shelf S logo with peacock teal and marigold
+
+**Severity:** Medium · **Owner decision:** Yes · **Status:** Applied (Nov 1)
+
+**Gap.** No document defines a logo. E-32 set a blue accent (`#0A66D8`) close to stock iOS blue, and the UI exploration on Oct 31 found it read as generic; it left the brand colour open.
+
+**Decision (Nov 1, owner).** The owner asked for a logo that feels rooted and trusted, soft and rounded, built from "shelf meets voice", named "Shelf Voice AI", and not like political colours, Indian payment apps, AI sparkles or a mic with sound waves. From six concepts in three palettes (`brand/logo-concepts.png`, `brand/logo-palette-matrix.png`) the owner chose:
+
+1. **Mark: Shelf S.** An S drawn as a two-bay shelf: a marigold item in the upper bay, a speech bubble in the lower. The favicon drops the bubble so it holds at 16 px. Files are in `brand/logo`; the app draws it from `src/components/brand/logo.tsx`.
+2. **Wordmark:** "Shelf Voice" in Baloo 2 ExtraBold, "Voice" in teal, with "AI" on a marigold price tag. Baloo 2 is used for the wordmark only; screens keep the phone's own font (E-32).
+3. **Colour: peacock teal and marigold.** Accent `#0E5A5E` (7.9:1 on white) replaces `#0A66D8`; dark mode uses `#5FC4BE` for text and `#13777C` for filled buttons (white text 5.3:1). Marigold `#F29F05` replaces turmeric as the low-stock fill, behind dark text only (7.8:1).
+
+A web search found no brand named Shelf Voice and no tag-bubble, shelf-bubble or S-shelf mark; it was not a formal trademark search, so check the final mark on IP India and a reverse image search before filing.
+
+| Doc | Page | Section | Change |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 06 | 1 | U1 Visual direction | Accent `#0A66D8` → peacock teal `#0E5A5E`; turmeric → marigold `#F29F05` (E-35) |
+| 06 | 5–7 | Tokens | Add the logo, wordmark face and the teal and marigold tokens in `src/app/globals.css` |
